### Health
GET http://localhost:8000/health

### Create quote
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/quotes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer": {
    "business_name": "ACME SRL",
    "vat_number": "IT00000000000",
    "address": "Via Roma 1, Torino",
    "contact_name": "Mario Rossi",
    "email": "mario@example.com"
  },
  "project_name": "Nuovo sito corporate",
  "project_type": "web",
  "items": [
    {"code": "WEB_BASE_5", "quantity": 1},
    {"code": "AUTO_CONTENT", "quantity": 1}
  ],
  "discount": {"amount": 300, "reason": "Promo commerciale"},
  "valid_days": 14,
  "delivery_weeks": "3-4 settimane",
  "acceptance_criteria": ["Staging approvato", "Form contatto operativo"],
  "exclusions": ["Produzione testi e immagini"]
}

### The create response contains quote_id and public_token/public_url.
### Continue through Swagger or the customer URL for the remaining lifecycle.
